in Markdown format.\\n    *   Check metadata footer format.\\n\\n7.  **Execution Plan:**\\n    *   Write Chapter Title (H1).\\n    *   Write Intro Paragraph.\\n    *   Write U1 content (Associations, Heterogeneity, Regimen specificity).\\n    *   Write U2 content (ABX, PPI, Confounding).\\n    *   Write U3 content (Longitudinal, Dynamics).\\n    *   Write U4 content (Interventions, Safety, Evidence Gap) + Table.\\n    *   Add Metadata Footer.\\n\\n    *Self-Correction on Length:* Writing the entire chapter in one go might be too long for a single response. However, the `current_task_ids` includes all Ch1 tasks. I will attempt to cover all of them but prioritize coherence. If I feel it's getting too long, I will ensure the critical points of each unit are covered. Given the instruction \\\"current_scope_partial_body_markdown\\\" is empty and \\\"output_continuation\\\" is false, I am starting fresh. I will write the full chapter content.\\n\\n    *Refining U1:* Start with the consensus on diversity and specific taxa, then move to the heterogeneity (cohort effect), then cancer-specific nuances (HCC, Prostate), then regimen specificity (JCOG2007).\\n    *Refining U2:* ABX timing and magnitude, PPI mechanism (oral bacteria), confounding.\\n    *Refining U3:* Baseline limitations, longitudinal stability, specific dynamic patterns (harmful bacteria loss).\\n    *Refining U4:* FMT efficacy (初治 vs 难治), Safety (Prevotella), Lack of Phase III. Insert Table.\\n\\n    *Let's check the source details again for accuracy:*\\n    *   P0298: Meta-analysis, NSCLC & Melanoma. High alpha diversity HR 0.52 (OS).\\n    *   P0478: Cross-cohort melanoma. Cohort effect > clinical variables. AUC 0.59-0.60 cross-cohort.\\n    *   P0585: JCOG2007. NIC vs PC. *Fusicatenibacter* HR 0.56 (NIC).\\n    *   P0081: Meta-analysis. ABX HR 1.61 (OS). PPI HR 1.28 (OS).\\n    *   P0583: FMT-LUMINate. NSCLC ORR 80%, Melanoma ORR 75%. Safety issue (myocarditis) with Prevotella in dual ICI.\\n    *   P0578: MITRIC. Refractory. ORR 0%.\\n    *   P0584/P0273: No Phase III RCTs.\\n\\n    *Okay, ready to write.*\\n\\n    *Wait, one more check:* The prompt says \\\"accepted_body_markdown\\\" is empty. This means I am writing the *very beginning* of the document. I should probably include the Chapter Title.\\n    *Also, I need to make sure I don't produce a \\\"thought process\\\" in the output.*\\n\\n    *Structure:*\\n    # 第一章 实体瘤中肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\\n    (Intro)\\n    (U1 Content)\\n    (U2 Content)\\n    (U3 Content)\\n    (U4 Content + Table)\\n    (Metadata)\\n\\n    *Let's begin.*\"}}],\"id\":\"chatcmpl-b75e65e5-267e-9c15-b74c-5eca8cb28fa3\",\"model\":\"qwen3.5-plus\",\"usage\":{\"completion_tokens\":6354,\"completion_tokens_details\":{\"reasoning_tokens\":2192,\"text_tokens\":6354},\"prompt_tokens\":559493,\"prompt_tokens_details\":{\"text_tokens\":559493},\"total_tokens\":565847}}",
